  "title": "Union Pacific Recognizes Companies with Pinnacle Award for Safely Shipping Hazardous Materials | Union Pacific",
  "summary": "Union Pacific Railroad recognized 138 companies with the 2025 Pinnacle Award for their dedication and commitment to safely transporting chemicals by rail. The annual award honors customers who implement release prevention protocols, corrective action plans and have zero non-accident releases of regulated hazardous materials shipments.",
